13	 * both let that delimiter be written inside them, and both have to hand back two
14	 * forms of themselves — what was written, so an error can quote it, and what it
15	 * stands for, so the engine can use it.
16	 *
17	 * A string may escape with a backslash as well, the way GQL and SQL both allow. A
18	 * quoted name may not: a name is a name, and letting it carry a newline would make
19	 * two different declarations print identically.
